config RTL8723DS
	tristate "Realtek RTL8723DS SDIO WiFi"
	depends on MMC && CFG80211
	help
	  This option enables the vendor Realtek RTL8723DS SDIO wireless
	  driver, integrated into the kernel tree as a regular module.

	  To build it as a module, choose M here. The module will be called
	  8723ds.
